{"title":"2012 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2012 AMC 12B Problems\">2012 AMC 12B #1</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2012 AMC 10B Problems\">2012 AMC 10B #1</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each third-grade classroom at Pearl Creek Elementary has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e7a1b6098a8c98b8e4adae526aeef4b91712620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> students and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> pet rabbits. How many more students than rabbits are there in all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> of the third-grade classrooms?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/0/b20c7a9749cc9f688d34c84a1db15346ef74b2fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 48\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 56\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 64\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 72\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Multiplying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e7a1b6098a8c98b8e4adae526aeef4b91712620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/d/94db15b430439ad5b3c80bfacfef0c6499ede2ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$72$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> students and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> rabbits. We then subtract: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/9/d0914946e2bdbed392ffe413a9820ed6be59adf3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$72 - 8 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 64}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"141\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>In each class, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/4/e841530890818ebbd94f1a60a873ea43ce2f80aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18-2=16$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"91\" height=\"13\" /> more students than rabbits. So for all classrooms, the difference between students and rabbits is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/3/0b3783d8552c51d59ae8782d8e35df50785c7ff8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16 \\times 4 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 64}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"137\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10B\" title=\"2012 AMC 10B\">2012 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2012 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2012 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2012 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2012 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2012 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2012 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2012 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2012 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2012 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2012 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index